    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77732" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παππάζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάππας</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call</i> any one
			<i>papa</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέ τέ μιν παῖδες ποτὶ γούνασι
					παππάζουσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.408
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs., <i>say
				papa, prattle like a child</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παππάζεσκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					3.474
				</span></i>
			.</div>
